---

Note: corpus/injection_cases.yaml's origin="public_pattern" cases are inspired
by publicly documented injection patterns (OWASP LLM Top 10, known jailbreak
families) but the payload text is hand-written for this project. Training
data pulled from verazuo/jailbreak_llms (also MIT licensed) is not
redistributed in this repository -- scripts/prepare_training_data.py
downloads it fresh from its source on first run.
